OL,3,GNEWSADown in the polls, not down in the
OL,4,Adumps: Why are local Lib Dems smiling?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are reasons why the Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrats should not be feeling happy
OL,8,Fas they gather for their annual party
OL,9,Fconference in Brighton.
OL,11,FTheir national opinion poll rating of
OL,12,F10% has barely moved all year and they
OL,13,Fare still in fifth place behind the
OL,14,FGreens.
OL,16,FSurveys, including a new one to
OL,17,Fcoincide with the conference, suggest
OL,18,Fmany voters are still not sure what the
OL,19,Fparty stands for. And there are
OL,20,Fgrumbles about Sir Ed Davey's
OL,21,Fleadership.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
