OL,3,GNEWSADown in the polls, not down in the
OL,4,Adumps: Why are local Lib Dems smiling?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut for the Lib Dems in the east of
OL,7,FEngland, things have never looked so
OL,8,Fgood. The party has a record number of
OL,9,FMPs and is running a record number of
OL,10,Flocal councils.
